    "value": "## Alain Berset\nSELECT *\nwhere {\n    \n    # p88459\n    <https://elites-suisses.lod4hss.org/resource/p69819> ?p ?o.\n    OPTIONAL {?p rdfs:label ?pLabel}\n\n}\n\n",
